 "remarks": "This stunning contemporary retreat with a pool is privately situated on 2.5 acres along a quiet lane off Stanwich Road. Offered fully furnished for either long- or short-term rental, the home combines sophisticated style with relaxed living. An expansive chef's kitchen overlooks the beautiful grounds and flows seamlessly into the formal dining room and spacious living room, where oversized windows capture picturesque pond views.The thoughtfully designed layout features two bedrooms and a full bath on the main level. Upstairs, the private primary suite includes a generous walk-in closet, while an additional en-suite bedroom offers comfort for family or guests. Flexible living spaces provide excellent options for a home office or den. A full bath on the lower level offers convenient access to the pool.Enjoy peaceful surroundings just minutes from downtown Greenwich, schools and transportation. Long-term rental: $15,000 per month. Short-term rental: $17,500 per month.",
